(530,323,$mw$7C6C5FBBEA54656401FF4A7522103C2D3D57C8D6DBFE619448EDD62018C7A1FB$mw$,$mw$de1e0837f6317a6a5ff7515d11ce4eb3$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":323,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"أوجد \\(f'(6)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=7x^{7}\\).","TitleEn":"Find f'(6) for \\(f(x)=7x^{7}\\).","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد \\(f'(6)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=7x^{7}\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Find f'(6) for \\(f(x)=7x^{7}\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مشتقة أ س^ن هي أ ن س^(ن−1). في f(س) = 7س^7 تكون f'(س) = 7 × 7س^6 = 49س^6. عند س = 6 نحسب f'(6) = 49 × 6^6 = 49 × 46656 = 2286144. نشتق أولاً ثم نعوّض بقيمة س.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Power rule: d(ax^n)/dx = anx^(n−1). For f(x) = 7x^7, f'(x) = 7 × 7x^6 = 49x^6. Then f'(6) = 49 × 6^6 = 49 × 46656 = 2286144. Differentiate first, then substitute the given x.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1281,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"2286144","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1282,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"2286145","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1283,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"2286147","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1284,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"2286142","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اشتق الدالة قبل التعويض.","En":"Differentiate before substituting."},{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة ثم عوّض المدخل المحدد.","En":"Apply the power rule, then substitute the given input."}],"Title":{"Ar":"أوجد \\(f'(6)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=7x^{7}\\).","En":"Find f'(6) for \\(f(x)=7x^{7}\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"2286144"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 49 في 46656؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 49 times 46656; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2286145"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 49 في 46656؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 49 times 46656; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2286147"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 49 في 46656؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 49 times 46656; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2286142"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد \\(f'(6)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=7x^{7}\\).","En":"Find f'(6) for \\(f(x)=7x^{7}\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة القوة: نضرب المعامل بالأس وننقص الأس واحداً.","En":"Power rule: multiply coefficient by exponent and reduce exponent by one."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=49x^{6}$.","En":"Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=49x^{6}$."},{"Ar":"عوّض $x=6$: $49\\times6^{6}=2286144$.","En":"Substitute $x=6$: $49\\times6^{6}=2286144$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2286144$","En":"$2286144$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض في الدالة الأصلية بدل المشتقة.","En":"Do not substitute into the original function rather than its derivative."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$f'(x)=49x^{6},\\quad f'(6)=49\\times6^{6}=2286144$","En":"$f'(x)=49x^{6},\\quad f'(6)=49\\times6^{6}=2286144$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6^{6}=46656,\\quad49\\times46656=2286144$","En":"$6^{6}=46656,\\quad49\\times46656=2286144$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":49,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اشتق الدالة قبل التعويض.","En":"Differentiate before substituting."},{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة ثم عوّض المدخل المحدد.","En":"Apply the power rule, then substitute the given input."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة القوة: نضرب المعامل بالأس وننقص الأس واحداً.","En":"Power rule: multiply coefficient by exponent and reduce exponent by one."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=49x^{6}$.","En":"Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=49x^{6}$."},{"Ar":"عوّض $x=6$: $49\\times6^{6}=2286144$.","En":"Substitute $x=6$: $49\\times6^{6}=2286144$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2286144$","En":"$2286144$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض في الدالة الأصلية بدل المشتقة.","En":"Do not substitute into the original function rather than its derivative."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$f'(x)=49x^{6},\\quad f'(6)=49\\times6^{6}=2286144$","En":"$f'(x)=49x^{6},\\quad f'(6)=49\\times6^{6}=2286144$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6^{6}=46656,\\quad49\\times46656=2286144$","En":"$6^{6}=46656,\\quad49\\times46656=2286144$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 49 في 46656؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 49 times 46656; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 49 في 46656؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 49 times 46656; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 49 في 46656؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 49 times 46656; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قاعدة القوة: نضرب المعامل بالأس وننقص الأس واحداً.

$\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}$

1. طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=49x^{6}$.

2. عوّض $x=6$: $49\times6^{6}=2286144$.

$f'(x)=49x^{6},\quad f'(6)=49\times6^{6}=2286144$

$2286144$ بلا وحدة قياس

$6^{6}=46656,\quad49\times46656=2286144$

لا تعوض في الدالة الأصلية بدل المشتقة.$mw$,$mw$Power rule: multiply coefficient by exponent and reduce exponent by one.

$\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}$

1. Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=49x^{6}$.

2. Substitute $x=6$: $49\times6^{6}=2286144$.

$f'(x)=49x^{6},\quad f'(6)=49\times6^{6}=2286144$

$2286144$ Dimensionless

$6^{6}=46656,\quad49\times46656=2286144$

Do not substitute into the original function rather than its derivative.$mw$),
(531,324,$mw$152860E45D6CACB4D526A4E1678DCE2ECB851555EFC3C6190DE0D843C89F026B$mw$,$mw$676b5f83659162d5dd03e457182efcf6$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":324,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب \\(\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx\\).","TitleEn":"Compute \\(\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx\\).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب \\(\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Compute \\(\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون التكامل غير المحدد للقوى: ∫أ س^ن dس = أ × س^(ن+1)/(ن+1) + C، ما دام ن ≠ −1. لدينا ∫36س^5 dس، نزيد الأس إلى 6 ونقسم المعامل على 6: (36/6)س^6 + C = 6س^6 + C. نضيف ثابت التكامل C لأن التكامل غير محدد.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Indefinite power-integration rule: ∫a x^n dx = a x^(n+1)/(n+1) + C when n ≠ −1. For ∫36x^5 dx, raise the exponent to 6 and divide the coefficient by 6: (36/6)x^6 + C = 6x^6 + C. Include integration constant C.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1285,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"36x^{6}+C","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1286,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"6x^{5}+C","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1287,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"36x^{5}+C","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1288,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"6x^{6}+C","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة التكامل للقوى.","En":"Use the integration power rule."},{"Ar":"ارفع الأس واحداً ثم اقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Raise the exponent by one and divide the coefficient by the new exponent."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx\\).","En":"Compute \\(\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $216x^{5}$ لا $36x^{5}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $216x^{5}$, not $36x^{5}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"36x^{6}+C"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $30x^{4}$ لا $36x^{5}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $30x^{4}$, not $36x^{5}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6x^{5}+C"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $180x^{4}$ لا $36x^{5}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $180x^{4}$, not $36x^{5}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"36x^{5}+C"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"6x^{6}+C"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx\\).","En":"Compute \\(\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التكامل غير المحدد عكس الاشتقاق؛ نزيد الأس ونقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: raise the power and divide the coefficient by the new power."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ارفع الأس 5 إلى 6؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\\ne-1$.","En":"Raise exponent 5 to 6; the power rule applies because $n\\ne-1$."},{"Ar":"اقسم المعامل 36 على 6 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.","En":"Divide coefficient 36 by 6 and add integration constant $C$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6x^{6}+C$","En":"$6x^{6}+C$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس ثابت التكامل أو القسمة.","En":"Do not omit the integration constant or division."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int ax^n\\,dx=\\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\\quad(n\\ne-1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx=\\frac{36}{6}x^{6}+C$","En":"$\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx=\\frac{36}{6}x^{6}+C$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(6x^{6}+C)'=36x^{5}$","En":"$(6x^{6}+C)'=36x^{5}$"}},"TrackIds":[12],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":50,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة التكامل للقوى.","En":"Use the integration power rule."},{"Ar":"ارفع الأس واحداً ثم اقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Raise the exponent by one and divide the coefficient by the new exponent."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التكامل غير المحدد عكس الاشتقاق؛ نزيد الأس ونقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: raise the power and divide the coefficient by the new power."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ارفع الأس 5 إلى 6؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\\ne-1$.","En":"Raise exponent 5 to 6; the power rule applies because $n\\ne-1$."},{"Ar":"اقسم المعامل 36 على 6 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.","En":"Divide coefficient 36 by 6 and add integration constant $C$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6x^{6}+C$","En":"$6x^{6}+C$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس ثابت التكامل أو القسمة.","En":"Do not omit the integration constant or division."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int ax^n\\,dx=\\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\\quad(n\\ne-1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx=\\frac{36}{6}x^{6}+C$","En":"$\\int 36x^{5}\\,dx=\\frac{36}{6}x^{6}+C$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(6x^{6}+C)'=36x^{5}$","En":"$(6x^{6}+C)'=36x^{5}$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $216x^{5}$ لا $36x^{5}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $216x^{5}$, not $36x^{5}$."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $30x^{4}$ لا $36x^{5}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $30x^{4}$, not $36x^{5}$."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $180x^{4}$ لا $36x^{5}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $180x^{4}$, not $36x^{5}$."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$التكامل غير المحدد عكس الاشتقاق؛ نزيد الأس ونقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.

$\int ax^n\,dx=\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\quad(n\ne-1)$

1. ارفع الأس 5 إلى 6؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\ne-1$.

2. اقسم المعامل 36 على 6 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.

$\int 36x^{5}\,dx=\frac{36}{6}x^{6}+C$

$6x^{6}+C$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(6x^{6}+C)'=36x^{5}$

لا تنس ثابت التكامل أو القسمة.$mw$,$mw$Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: raise the power and divide the coefficient by the new power.

$\int ax^n\,dx=\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\quad(n\ne-1)$

1. Raise exponent 5 to 6; the power rule applies because $n\ne-1$.

2. Divide coefficient 36 by 6 and add integration constant $C$.

$\int 36x^{5}\,dx=\frac{36}{6}x^{6}+C$

$6x^{6}+C$ Dimensionless

$(6x^{6}+C)'=36x^{5}$

Do not omit the integration constant or division.$mw$),
(532,325,$mw$ED85812600F9C16D9B46C358212A926524D902A124ED54A61410D627AF3979BB$mw$,$mw$c6e9fecd7fed9d0052c9f58f37294790$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":325,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{7} 12t\\,dt\\).","TitleEn":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{7} 12t\\,dt\\).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{7} 12t\\,dt\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{7} 12t\\,dt\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مبرهنة التكامل الأساسية؛ التكامل المحدد من 0 إلى 7 للدالة 12t يساوي F(7) − F(0)، حيث F(t) = (12/2)t² = 6t². بالتعويض: 6 × 7² − 6 × 0² = 6 × 49 = 294.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Fundamental Theorem of Calculus: Evaluate ∫₀^7 12t dt as F(7) − F(0), where F(t) = (12/2)t² = 6t². Substitute: 6 × 7² − 6 × 0² = 6 × 49 = 294.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1289,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"297","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1290,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"292","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1291,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"294","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1292,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"295","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"أوجد الدالة الأصلية أولاً.","En":"Find the antiderivative first."},{"Ar":"عوّض الحدين في الدالة الأصلية واطرح.","En":"Evaluate both bounds in the antiderivative and subtract."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{7} 12t\\,dt\\).","En":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{7} 12t\\,dt\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 7 والارتفاع 84؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 7 and height 84; check both bounds."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"297"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 7 والارتفاع 84؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 7 and height 84; check both bounds."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"292"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"294"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 7 والارتفاع 84؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 7 and height 84; check both bounds."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"295"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{7} 12t\\,dt\\).","En":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{7} 12t\\,dt\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مبرهنة التفاضل والتكامل الأساسية تطرح قيمة الدالة الأصلية عند الحد الأدنى من الأعلى.","En":"The fundamental theorem subtracts the antiderivative at the lower bound from its value at the upper bound."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"دالة أصلية للتعبير هي $F(t)=6t^2$.","En":"An antiderivative is $F(t)=6t^2$."},{"Ar":"احسب الفرق: $F(7)-F(0)=6\\times7^2=294$.","En":"Evaluate the difference: $F(7)-F(0)=6\\times7^2=294$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$294$","En":"$294$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تترك ثابت تكامل في الناتج المحدد.","En":"Do not leave an integration constant in a definite integral."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int_a^b f(t)\\,dt=F(b)-F(a)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\left[6t^2\\right]_0^{7}=6(7^2-0)=294$","En":"$\\left[6t^2\\right]_0^{7}=6(7^2-0)=294$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"مشتقة $F$ هي $12t$، ومساحة المثلث تحت المستقيم تساوي $\\frac12\\times7\\times84=294$.","En":"The derivative of $F$ is $12t$; the triangular area is $\\frac12\\times7\\times84=294$."}},"TrackIds":[12],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":51,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"أوجد الدالة الأصلية أولاً.","En":"Find the antiderivative first."},{"Ar":"عوّض الحدين في الدالة الأصلية واطرح.","En":"Evaluate both bounds in the antiderivative and subtract."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مبرهنة التفاضل والتكامل الأساسية تطرح قيمة الدالة الأصلية عند الحد الأدنى من الأعلى.","En":"The fundamental theorem subtracts the antiderivative at the lower bound from its value at the upper bound."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"دالة أصلية للتعبير هي $F(t)=6t^2$.","En":"An antiderivative is $F(t)=6t^2$."},{"Ar":"احسب الفرق: $F(7)-F(0)=6\\times7^2=294$.","En":"Evaluate the difference: $F(7)-F(0)=6\\times7^2=294$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$294$","En":"$294$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تترك ثابت تكامل في الناتج المحدد.","En":"Do not leave an integration constant in a definite integral."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int_a^b f(t)\\,dt=F(b)-F(a)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\left[6t^2\\right]_0^{7}=6(7^2-0)=294$","En":"$\\left[6t^2\\right]_0^{7}=6(7^2-0)=294$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"مشتقة $F$ هي $12t$، ومساحة المثلث تحت المستقيم تساوي $\\frac12\\times7\\times84=294$.","En":"The derivative of $F$ is $12t$; the triangular area is $\\frac12\\times7\\times84=294$."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 7 والارتفاع 84؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 7 and height 84; check both bounds."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 7 والارتفاع 84؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 7 and height 84; check both bounds."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 7 والارتفاع 84؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 7 and height 84; check both bounds."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مبرهنة التفاضل والتكامل الأساسية تطرح قيمة الدالة الأصلية عند الحد الأدنى من الأعلى.

$\int_a^b f(t)\,dt=F(b)-F(a)$

1. دالة أصلية للتعبير هي $F(t)=6t^2$.

2. احسب الفرق: $F(7)-F(0)=6\times7^2=294$.

$\left[6t^2\right]_0^{7}=6(7^2-0)=294$

$294$ بلا وحدة قياس

مشتقة $F$ هي $12t$، ومساحة المثلث تحت المستقيم تساوي $\frac12\times7\times84=294$.

لا تترك ثابت تكامل في الناتج المحدد.$mw$,$mw$The fundamental theorem subtracts the antiderivative at the lower bound from its value at the upper bound.

$\int_a^b f(t)\,dt=F(b)-F(a)$

1. An antiderivative is $F(t)=6t^2$.

2. Evaluate the difference: $F(7)-F(0)=6\times7^2=294$.

$\left[6t^2\right]_0^{7}=6(7^2-0)=294$

$294$ Dimensionless

The derivative of $F$ is $12t$; the triangular area is $\frac12\times7\times84=294$.

Do not leave an integration constant in a definite integral.$mw$),
